The water dimer of case 227 in a slab cell open along y (16 bohr), with assume_isolated pcc_2d, pcc_2d_axis 1
and sccs_lowpass_p1 10 / sccs_lowpass_p2 5: FFT derivatives of the filled solvent-aware
boundary, and the electronic cavity potential as the exact derivative of the discrete energy
through the probe adjoint. (pcc_0d would need a cubic cell.)

